Annotation rules (see .claude/rules/tasks-generation.md):
- _Requirements: 1.1, 1.2_ — numeric IDs only, no descriptions.
- _Boundary: ComponentName_ — required on (P) tasks; matches a component from design.md.
- _Depends: 3.1, 4.2_ — cross-boundary dependencies only; sequential order is implicit.
- (P) — parallel-capable, runs alongside other (P) tasks in different boundaries.

Test-first (TDD): every behavior is a RED test sub-task immediately followed by
the minimal GREEN implementation sub-task. Write the failing test, confirm it
fails for the expected reason, then write the least code to pass; refactor under
green. Sub-tasks: 1-3 hours of focused work.
-->

